": "1649951459463035", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1649951462796368_6495437171366118499_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SXmYrDCa344Q7kNvwGXIZ1h&_nc_oc=AdqatE-at2zbIc-DHzjAjX1O4Y8baYHQBZ0M3TmhWwNZq76_3j77N8_IEMVYGNUh8ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2n5jsI9WcwovMUFNOya_xAfgRxAM9KvwSLnae-T7CFg&oe=6B071AC8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "796010373336947", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_796010376670280_1622690528672245878_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CFStUPWxrmgQ7kNvwHwsMEU&_nc_oc=AdraWUytNQ6aly4gXBXbra-EnNLtxrWTn7QwxeTQ6NouoEaKQe5RERpSHpbBRZOqHPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRvrSWu4S2V7sGmDCH5V72IOen8ndp-hnRQQrILblhMOQ&oe=6B0715C8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "900207153052082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_900207156385415_3810073691747307333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H3EjR6P8u80Q7kNvwH-ZGfe&_nc_oc=AdpgYw1SjlyYQYw6xHLMyzUG4jAQcQnQG2Nyf901jzix98B5wf53LMd5OUTl1_VebaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRzK4j9uqt8JThOhe2zrjtZfrp-ZN0mFrj7uEu2z7Q9pw&oe=6B06F4EF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "947398901258988", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_947398904592321_4765479034696321724_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E-2oJDouuHwQ7kNvwH_od7h&_nc_oc=AdpzqycSfLiAnmidahfdlPZU6-ifRBvxXUITjt73qwhmhDJX7a8QB3lFyExPSY7X3r0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTmHg2JPCB1YOY1EEENmA0wdTIP87qscjSnrSl1zA1CpQ&oe=6B0715BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Snapshot_1.PNG", "id": "712382138600986", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_712382141934319_6039130477330376030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrplX7iBH14Q7kNvwHQL188&_nc_oc=AdpZoP5BjFS1xLxwoBvDWxPBkvZ9YolOmaWjBuC__IHXgDhXwEmcej-W5_InvaYNYPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSaeDnpxOG01R8lOYhMn34OsktKexfU8pVqe5mAKCzMhA&oe=6B071505"}, "display_name": "The Abstract Art Gallery", "keywords": ["Abstract", "Art", "Gallery", "Neon", "Paintings"], "long_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944). He was one of the most important 20th-century artists. He was a major figure in modern art and painted some of the first modern abstract works.\n\nThe experience does not show the original paintings of Wassily Kandinsky, instead it presents a Neon-Futuristic version of each painting. You have a play button on each panting to see an AI Animation made with the Meta AI.\n\nThe exposition is divided in 6 sections (each section contains 10 paintings), and there is a transportation point to move from one section to another.\n\nKandinsky also developed a theory of geometric figures and their relationships, claiming (for example) that the circle is the most peaceful shape and represents the human soul.", "short_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-15_19.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4349619